# Large data files.
#
# KJV.json is deliberately NOT here. As of 2026-07-28 its content is DERIVED,
# not merely downloaded — tools/build_local_bibles.py strips the Apocrypha from
# the upstream Bolls KJV (37,247 -> 31,102 verses). The other three below are
# pristine third-party downloads that any clone can re-fetch unchanged, so
# there is nothing of ours to lose. KJV.json is tracked alongside ASV/BSB/YLT,
# which are derived the same way (the 16 carried disputed verses).
BDBT.json
strongs.json
strongs-dictionary.xhtml

# Binary PDFs
StraitWay/
Noble_Mind_Study_Tool_User_Guide_v2.pdf
Bible_Study_Guiding_Principles_Preface.pdf

# Backup files
*.backup
*.backup.*

# Old/intermediate HTML versions
Noble_Mind_Study_Tool_v2_ocr_improved_pdftext_vaults.html

# Utility scripts (not deployed)
convert_strongs.py
update_map.py

# Python cache
__pycache__/

# Source manuscripts (not deployed)
a_new_and_living_way/

# Claude config
.claude/

# LibreOffice lock files
.~lock.*#

# Lulu cover templates (downloaded per-book, vendor-provided)
*-cover-template.pdf
*hardcover-template.pdf
*Edition-Jacket.pdf

# IngramSpark cover generator templates (downloaded per-book)
*_Cover_Generator_Template.pdf

# Lulu preflight/draft output (derived, large)
*_DRAFT_print_ready*.zip
*_DRAFT_print_ready/

# Lulu source-file bundles (uploaded to Lulu, not source of truth)
*-source.zip

# Offline interactive-timeline bundles — regenerated on every deploy by
# tools/build_timeline_bundle.py (the embedded-font cache IS committed).
old-testament-timeline/Old_Testament_Timeline_Interactive.zip
the-life-of-christ/The_Life_of_Christ_Interactive.zip
the-church-christ-built/The_Church_Christ_Built_Interactive.zip
apostle-paul/The_Apostle_Paul_Interactive.zip
tools/_bundle_build/
_bundle_verify/
_b_*.png
_hz_*.png

# Personalized Special Edition outputs (private gift copies, never deployed)
A_Good_Name/YourNameMeansEverything_Special_Edition_*.pdf
A_Good_Name/Message-to-Hagen.pdf

# Audiobook working folders — large WAV masters and TTS source files. The
# compressed MP3s live in each book's audio/ directory and are tracked.
**/Audio Files/
**/Text Files for Audio/
**/text-files-for-audio/
**/audio-files-for-book/
**/audio-files/
*.wav
console/noblemind-console

# Cloud TTS scratch (scripts are tracked; outputs and refs are not)
cloud-tts/*.mp3
cloud-tts/*.wav
cloud-tts/inputs/

# WhatLoveLooksLike script outputs (regenerable from caption_panels.py and
# mockup_typography.py; the source panel PNGs at the WLLL root are tracked)
WhatLoveLooksLike/captioned/
WhatLoveLooksLike/mockup/

# MadeNotWritten: rejected AI-generated cover candidates from the
# cover-selection conversation (cherub, robot, etc.). Local reference
# only — the chosen cover is purely typographic.
MadeNotWritten/grok-image.jpg
MadeNotWritten/made-not-written-image.png

# apostle-paul: viz.bible reference screenshots kept local for visual
# comparison; not used in implementation (existing study-tool maps
# already have permanent city labels).
Works_In_Progress/apostle-paul-journey-refs/
